  "notes": "{普段|ふだん} refers to normal, everyday circumstances.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {普段|ふだん}は〜 (usually ~)\n- {普段|ふだん}から〜 (habitually; on a regular basis)\n- {普段|ふだん}の〜 (everyday ~; usual ~)\n- {普段|ふだん}どおり (as usual)\n\nCOMMON COMPOUNDS:\n- {普段着|ふだんぎ} (everyday clothes)\n- {普段使|ふだんづか}い (for everyday use)\n\nSIMILAR EXPRESSIONS:\n- いつも: always (more frequent than {普段|ふだん})\n- たいてい: usually, mostly\n- {通常|つうじょう}: normally (more formal)\n- {日常|にちじょう}: daily, everyday (noun)\n\nNUANCE:\n- {普段|ふだん} implies contrast with special occasions\n- Often used when comparing normal behavior to exceptions",
